# What `gcloud run deploy --source .` may upload. Without this file gcloud would follow .gitignore,
# which leaves out references/ (the image needs those) and has no idea about everything else here.
*
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!requirements.txt
!studio/
!studio/**
!templates/
!templates/**
!web/
!web/**
!references/
!references/**
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
